# E2E: the ONLY thing you maintain is this one token. Everything else (site, API, running the tests) is automatic.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.e2e.local` (git-ignored, never commit a token), then paste the token below:
#   1. Sign in to the site in a browser with a dedicated TEST account.
#   2. DevTools → Application → Local Storage → copy the value of `clothes_shop_refresh_token`.
#   3. Paste it after the "=".
# It lasts 30 days. When it expires, `yarn test:e2e` stops with a message saying so — paste a new one.
# Leave it empty to run only the signed-out flows (the signed-in ones are skipped).
